  "journey": [
    {"id":"overview","place":null,"component":null,"visits":[],"flows":[],"title":"One wish, shipped","text":"nana is a city that turns one wish into shipped work. Each place reads records before it acts and leaves a record behind. Scroll to follow one request around the loop."},
    {"id":"signal","place":"tower","component":null,"visits":[],"flows":[],"title":"A signal arrives","text":"The owner sends a wish from far away. It falls on the reception tower as a pulse of light."},
    {"id":"compass","place":"tower","component":"compass","visits":["court","style"],"flows":["court>drafting","watchtower>tower"],"title":"The reception tower","text":"The seat works in the tower. It reads the handoff note, the rulings and open questions. At each session start it checks main from the watchtower. It sends work into the park and posts questions back as asks."},
    {"id":"drafting-table","place":"drafting","component":"drafting-table","visits":["records"],"flows":["survey>drafting","ledger>drafting"],"title":"The drafting office","text":"A planner reads the requirement rows, its feature's known bugs and the survey office's search for similar code. It leaves a plan and the tests it must pass. An adversary tries to break them first."},
    {"id":"queue","place":"yard","component":"queue","visits":["night-depot"],"flows":[],"title":"The dispatch yard","text":"Plans wait here for a free bay. Two lanes build at once, and a third can be planned alongside."},
    {"id":"workshop","place":"bay-1","component":"workshop","visits":["tools","guards","survey"],"flows":["ledger>bay-1"],"title":"The workshop bays","text":"A builder takes the plan into a bay. It reads the plan, the code the plan names and its feature's known bugs. It carries no memory. It leaves tests, code and a build record."},
    {"id":"eyes","place":"inspection","component":"eyes","visits":["test-lab","control"],"flows":[],"title":"Inspection","text":"The visual judge holds each build against its reference picture. A failed check sends the work back to its bay."},
    {"id":"review-ladder","place":"ladder","component":"review-ladder","visits":["ledger"],"flows":["ladder>ledger"],"title":"The review ladder","text":"Reviewers from another model family read the change and the rows it moved. A blocking finding sends it back. Every other finding becomes a line in the known-bug ledger, which planners and builders read next."},
    {"id":"land-gate","place":"land-gate","component":"land-gate","visits":["vault","archive","watchtower"],"flows":["land-gate>archive","archive>drafting","watchtower>tower"],"title":"The land gate","text":"The gate opens only when every reviewer says LAND and CI is green. It is the park's only way out. Behind it, the archive keeps review and land records, with no road back to drafting yet."},
    {"id":"identity-scan","place":"customs","component":"identity-scan","visits":[],"flows":[],"title":"Customs","text":"At the city edge, customs scans the cargo for anything that names the owner or their work."},
    {"id":"release-route","place":"freight","component":"release-route","visits":["utilities","billboard","stage"],"flows":[],"title":"The freight road","text":"Release carries templates and setup out of the city. The billboard shows what shipped."},
    {"id":"customers","place":"customers","component":null,"visits":[],"flows":["customers>freight","customers>tower"],"title":"Customer towns","text":"Other projects built the nana way receive the templates. No road yet checks whether they fall behind. Their feedback returns only when the owner brings it."},
    {"id":"library","place":null,"component":"library","visits":[],"flows":["ledger>drafting","ledger>bay-1","ladder>ledger","archive>drafting","customers>freight","theater>tower"],"title":"The way back","text":"What returns today: known-bug lines reach planners and builders, and rulings, the handoff note and session notes reach the next seat. Review records have no road back yet. Builders get no library pull, by the owner's ruling."},
    {"id":"closing","place":null,"component":null,"visits":[],"flows":[],"title":"The whole city","text":"The tower at the centre, the factory park around it, the town around that, and one road out. Dark buildings and dark dashed roads are parts still to come."}
